  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Tukata</defName>
    <label>tuk'ata</label>
    <description>The tuk'ata (or 'Sith hounds'), were used for thousands of years to guard the tombs of the Dark Lords of the Sith on the planet Korriban. Tuk'ata were unusually intelligent and were even rumoured to communicate with one another through means unknown. It was claimed that originally the species were non-violent grazing animals before being corrupted by Sith alchemy experiments that awakened latent parts of their brain which transformed them into unnatural abominations (or 'Sithspawn'). Many small populations of these creatures were able to establish themselves on various worlds having escaped captivity from Sith armies they were indentured to.</description>
